Z||000009||theogre||01-27-2001||12:31 PM||||read also..... <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/007762.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/007762.html</A>  there are a bunch of issues around this upgrade. There are other threads that also raise serious questions.<BR>||||reg||1
